    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Uphold the Laws That Bind Society</p></blockquote><p>The Order Domain represents discipline and devotion to the laws that govern a society, an institution, or a philosophy. Clerics of Order meditate on logic and justice as they serve their gods. They believe that well-crafted laws establish legitimate hierarchies, that those chosen by law to lead must be obeyed, and that leaders who fail to protect the law must be replaced. In this way, law weaves a web of obligations that brings order and security to a chaotic multiverse.</p><h4>Order Domain Deities</h4><table><thead><tr><th>Example Deity</th><th>Pantheon</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Aureon</td><td>Eberron</td></tr><tr><td>Bane</td><td>Forgotten Realms</td></tr><tr><td>Majere</td><td>Dragonlance</td></tr><tr><td>Pholtus</td><td>Greyhawk</td></tr><tr><td>Tyr</td><td>Forgotten Realms</td></tr><tr><td>Wee Jas</td><td>Greyhawk</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Subclass of Tasha's Cauldron of Everything, adapted to the 2024 rules by Owidyn.</em></p><p><em>Its Divine Strike (Cleric level 8) is replaced by the Blessed Strikes of the 2024 Cleric.</em></p><h3>Order Domain Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.vIL5St0UCoByOPXH]{Order Domain Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.IZkyDWLkygEDGQmD]{Bonus Proficiencies}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.ISKZHCvBk731ESZL]{Voice of Authority}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Wde66tV9vLQojmHp]{Order's Demand}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.DjaCye4KDSA2Tk6i]{Embodiment of the Law}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.45TYdV4DenSA0KFn]{Order's Wrath}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Order Domain Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Cleric Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCommand000]{Command}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHeroism000]{Heroism}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHoldPerson]{Hold Person}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplZoneofTrut]{Zone of Truth}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMassHealin]{Mass Healing Word}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSlow000000]{Slow}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCompulsion]{Compulsion}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLocateCrea]{Locate Creature}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCommune000]{Commune}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDominatePe]{Dominate Person}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
